t Editor on Android without installing an ad driven and likely untrustworthy keyboard. (This is not suggesting that installing 3rd party apps just to use another is acceptable in any case.)\n\nI believe this should create a drive for an effort to implement an optional keyboard for mobile or touch screen driven devices to use to close the gap. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nUse the editor on Android. \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nAndroid Godot Editor ","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12028/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12028/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened","pinned_comment":null}